# Daily operations (supercronic, UTC). See docs/operations.md.
# 00:30 UTC: after the month boundary, so close-month and issue-monthly see
# the new month on the 1st. ops:daily takes a lock, so a manual run at the
# same time is skipped, not doubled.
30 0 * * * pnpm --silent ops:daily
# Every 15 minutes: usage alerts (80% and 100% of the allowance, 90% of the
# overage ceiling), each sent once per workspace and month.
*/15 * * * * pnpm --silent usage:alerts
